THIRD-PARTY ASSETS (NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENCE)

The MIT licence above applies ONLY to the source code in this repository.
The following third-party assets used by or referenced from this repository
carry their own upstream licences, which take precedence over the MIT grant
for those specific assets:

  - APTOS-2019 Blindness Detection images: Kaggle competition rules
    (https://www.kaggle.com/c/aptos2019-blindness-detection). Research use
    only; do not redistribute raw images.

  - IDRiD dataset: IEEE DataPort terms
    (https://idrid.grand-challenge.org/). Free research use after
    registration.

  - Messidor-2 colour fundus photographs: ADCIS research-use licence
    (https://www.adcis.net/en/third-party/messidor2/). Do not redistribute
    raw images. Adjudicated 5-class DR grades: Google Research Medical Brain
    team, released as the "messidor2-dr-grades" supplement on Kaggle.

  - RETFound pretrained weights: licence distributed with
    https://github.com/rmaphoh/RETFound_MAE. Research use only.

Users of this repository are responsible for complying with each upstream
licence when downloading, using, or citing those assets. The accompanying
paper acknowledges the relevant citations; please reuse those citations if
